   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-09-30",
   "text": "COVID-19 Testing Coverage Act of 2021\n\n This bill requires private health insurance to cover, without cost sharing, testing to assess the T cell immune response of an individual to COVID-19. This test indicates a recent or prior infection with COVID-19."
  }
